UID:b4093a8335929bef68e22424e36b60@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Jon Fisch is a New York City-based comedian who has appeared o
 n both The Late Show with David Letterman and The Late Show with Stephen C
 olbert\, as well as Comedy Central and NBC’s Last Comic Standing. A regu
 lar at New York’s Comedy Cellar and Gotham Comedy Club\, Jon has perform
 ed at the HBO Comedy Arts Festival\, Montreal’s Just for Laughs Festival
  and the Great American Comedy Festival. Jon brings that same perspective 
 to Spiraling Up\, his podcast featuring candid and funny conversations wit
 h comedians about life\, struggles\, and getting through the tough spots w
 ith humor. Also on the show are comedians Dave Rattigan and AJ Hapenny. Co
 me see Jon Fisch live at Mechanics Hall for an evening of stand-up\, stori
 es\, and plenty of laughs. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event p
 age: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/comedian-jon-fisch/31162/\n\n
 Events Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Loc
 al fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discov
 ercentralma.org/event/comedian-jon-fisch/31162/
LOCATION:Mechanics Hall\, 321 Main St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/comedian-jon-fisch/31162/
