BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"Home for the Holidays: A European Grand Tour" @ Salisbury Mansion
  November 27\, 2026 - January 2\, 2027
DTSTART:20261127T000000
DTEND:20261127T000000
DTSTAMP:20261125T205332Z
UID:884e19c0a523becbe719bcdfebb844@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Museum of Worcester in collaboration with Preservation Worcest
 er invite you "Home for the Holidays: A European Grand Tour” running Fri
 day\, November 27\, Saturdays\, November 28\, December 5\, 12\, 19\, 26\; 
 January 2 from 5:30 - 7:00PM at Salisbury Mansion\, 40 Highland Street\, W
 orcester. Tours begin at Preservation Worcester’s Salisbury House\, Step
 hen Salisbury II's former home\, where you will enjoy a presentation highl
 ighting his life\, legacy\, and historic grand tour across Europe from 182
 9-1831 with Presentation sessions start at both 5:30 and 6:30PM at Salisbu
 ry House. From there\, step next door to Stephen II's childhood home at Sa
 lisbury Mansion\, where each room is adorned with festive holiday decor re
 presenting selected countries he visited. As you explore\, you will discov
 er the unique\, historical holiday traditions of each region he visited\, 
 while learning about the rapidly changing political and cultural landscape
  of 1830s Europe. COST: $15 per person and FREE for both Museum of Worcest
 er and Preservation Worcester members. Space is limited. Registration is r
 equired. Don’t miss this heartwarming tradition to start your holiday se
 ason! Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.disc
 overcentralma.org/event/home-for-the-holidays%3a-a-european-grand-tour-%40
 -salisbury-mansion-november-27-2026-january-2-2027/31449/\n\nEvents Near M
 e: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback f
 rom massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.o
 rg/event/home-for-the-holidays%3a-a-european-grand-tour-%40-salisbury-mans
 ion-november-27-2026-january-2-2027/31449/
LOCATION:Salisbury Mansion\, 40 Highland Street\, Worcester\, MA\, 01609
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/home-for-the-holidays%3a-a-eur
 opean-grand-tour-%40-salisbury-mansion-november-27-2026-january-2-2027/314
 49/
END:VEVENT
