DESCRIPTION:The Island of Misfit Animals November 27 through December 27\,
  2026 (Closed December 25th) Friday\, Saturday\, and Sunday Nights 5:30-8:
 00 PM with Live Animal Programs at 6:30 PM. Sell out nights will feature 2
  shows\, 6:30 and 7:15 pm. The Island of Misfit Animals: Christmas Fundrai
 ser is Back! Join us for The Island Of Misfit Animals 2026. Returning this
  year\, will be our most lovable “misfits” and some of their new frien
 ds! Fri\, Sat\, & Sun nights November 27 – December 27\, 2026. (Excludes
  Christmas Day) Open from 5:30-8 PM\, Live animal presentations will be of
 fered at 6:30\, where we will showcase the odd balls and make them feel a 
 little extra special this year. Then explore the zoo\, lit with Christmas 
 and Holiday lights and encounter all of the other rescued animals. Petting
  is allowed and we will have zookeepers available to introduce you to more
  of our “misfit” friends. Forget all the light the night walk arounds 
 and drive throughs\, come visit Animal Adventures’ Island of Misfit Anim
 als and make a difference for them this year! All proceeds go directly to 
 animal care through the winter. This Year’s Featured Misfit Guest is: TB
 D Stay tuned to find out\, and subscribe to our email list below! Tickets 
 are limited so buy online now! Available only at our Bolton\, MA location 
 336 Sugar Rd. Bolton\, MA 01740 Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Ev
 ent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/island-of-misfit-animals
 /31000/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDis
 covery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https:/
 /www.discovercentralma.org/event/island-of-misfit-animals/31000/
LOCATION:Animal Adventures Family Zoo & Rescue Center\, 336 Sugar Rd\, Bol
 ton\, MA\, 01740
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/island-of-misfit-animals/31000
