 eators include Michael Golden\, Steve Geiger\, Joe St. Pierre\, Bob Egglet
 on\, Marianne Plumridge\, Rick Keene\, Bob Tkacik\, Brian Hall and Mach Be
 ll. Activities include the daily Kids Cosplay Parade at noon\, NorthEast I
 dol Project programming\, and Saturday and Sunday Create-A-Character conte
 sts at noon. Friday and Saturday nights feature Cosplay Karaoke with the S
 tars\, hosted by Cowboy Mach Bell\, from 8 to 11 PM. Additional entertainm
 ent announcements will follow. Friday Nov. 27: 4-8 PM (VIP 3 PM)\; Saturda
 y Nov. 28: 10 AM-6 PM (VIP 9 AM)\; Sunday Nov. 29: 10 AM-4 PM (VIP 9 AM). 
