 ild a whimsical\, bent-top evergreen Grinch Tree on a tomato cage and deco
 rate it with colorful holiday accents. Finished project is about 3 feet ta
 ll\; leave room in your car! Leif - Meet Leif\, the red-capped cousin of m
 oss-hatted Sven! Create an evergreen gnome with a cheerful red cap\, match
 ing mittens\, and a prominent nose. Built on a tomato cage and about 3 fee
 t tall. Santa - Turn fresh evergreen branches into a jolly Santa with a re
 d hat and a pale\, flowing beard. Built on a tomato cage and about 3 feet 
 tall\; leave room in your car! Sven - Inspired by the tomte of Nordic folk
 lore\, Sven combines fragrant evergreens with a woodland moss cap and a sh
