BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nashville Christmas: Fireside Stories
DTSTART:20261128T000000
DTEND:20261128T000000
DTSTAMP:20261125T205332Z
UID:c133d8afa7aa5bf1dfb4464e77f3e6@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:This Christmas season\, step inside historic Blaxton Hall at V
 aillancourt Folk Art for Nashville Christmas: Fireside Stories\, an intima
 te evening of live music\, storytelling\, and conversation featuring accla
 imed Nashville songwriter James T. Slater and Massachusetts singer-songwri
 ter Sam James. A two-time Grammy-nominated songwriter\, Slater has written
  hit songs recorded by Kenny Chesney\, Tim McGraw\, Luke Combs\, Carrie Un
 derwood\, Reba McEntire\, Willie Nelson\, Martina McBride\, Keith Urban\, 
 and more. His credits include Martina McBride’s “In My Daughter’s Ey
 es\,” Jamey Johnson’s “The High Cost of Living\,” and Keith Urban
 ’s “God Whispered Your Name.” Sam James\, a Massachusetts-born singe
 r-songwriter and performer with more than one million social media followe
 rs\, will join Slater as co-host and performer. Rather than a traditional 
 concert\, Fireside Stories offers an intimate look at the stories and insp
 iration behind the songs\, along with reflections on Christmas traditions 
 and the artists’ musical journeys. Two performances will be held on Satu
 rday\, November 28\, at 1 PM and 5 PM at Blaxton Hall. Sources: Discover C
 entral Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/n
 ashville-christmas%3a-fireside-stories/30996/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30
  miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachu
 setts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/nas
 hville-christmas%3a-fireside-stories/30996/
LOCATION:Vaillancourt Folk Art\, 9 Main St. Suite 1h\, Sutton\, MA\, 01590
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/nashville-christmas%3a-firesid
 e-stories/30996/
END:VEVENT
